      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: "The Aids panel shows the state of the available safety and driving
        aids\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<b>Color codes</b>\n\n\tGreen\t\t\tEnabled
        and monitoring the car state\n\tYellow\t\tActuating on the car systems\n\tGray\t\t\tDisabled
